.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Why this talk?}

We stand at the gates of software's industrial age.
Do we possess the wisdom required for it?

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{What lies ahead?}

- Opposites are both true at different times and places
- It is wise to hear or discuss someone's truth, but not necessarily accept it

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

A technical solution is the most important!
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

~~A technical solution is the most important!~~
Value produced for the customer is!

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

Time and place are not important.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

~~Time and place are not important.~~
- What is your size?
  - 2-person band / 10 / 200 / 200,000
- When is "now"?
- Where is "here"?
  - IT agency / SaaS / your own product / government / medical / bank
- Who are your customers?

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

I am valuable because?
- I am fast
- I am good
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

I am valuable because?
- ~~I am fast~~
- ~~I am good~~

- I bring value to the company

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

Outcomes are for business folk.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in business}

~~Outcomes are for business folk.~~
Without caring for the outcome, you cannot bring value.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

Waterfall / Scrum / Agile ™
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

~~Waterfall / Scrum / Agile ™~~
The kind of collaboration that works for you and others at this time and place!

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

Colleague/department for X:
- database
- security
- Ops
- QA
- performance
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

~~Colleague/department for X~~
Expertise is great when it is used and needed sparsely.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

The estimate is correct.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in collaboration}

~~The estimate is correct.~~
- Who asks?
- Why do they ask?
- Seeing is believing!
- The correct scale is your friend

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

We need to prepare for the future.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

~~We need to prepare for the future.~~
Design for the here and now.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

The solution to a problem is obvious.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

~~The solution to a problem is obvious.~~
Sit and come up with at least 3 solutions; stupid ones are allowed.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

The end of a project is known.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in design}

~~The end of a project is known~~
- This is how EPIC legacy is created
- Habitable code is a continuous effort

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

New tech is better than old tech!
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~New tech is better than old tech!~~
- FOMO is real, I feel you ❤️
- Would it bring value and how costly is it?
- Can you make it cost less? 

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

Clean Code / DRY / SOLID / KISS / YAGNI / TDD / BDD / CI/CD / Pair programming / DDD / Microservices / SoC ™
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~Clean Code / DRY / SOLID / KISS / YAGNI / TDD / BDD / CI/CD / Pair programming / DDD / Microservices / SoC ™~~
- Time and place!
- Principles over rules!

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

The business domain is not relevant to the code.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~The business domain is not relevant to the code~~
You always have business domain even when you are not aware of it.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

Automated testing is not worth it!
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~Automated testing is not worth it!~~
- Simplest way to good interface
- Repeatable
- Time saver

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

Just use a library!
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~Just use a library!~~
You OWN the faults of everything your code depends on because the customer does not care.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

If a language feature exists, it is always good to use it.
- goto
- global vars
- singleton pattern
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~If a language feature exists, it is always good to use it.~~
In time and place!

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

AI will make us great!
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in coding}

~~AI will make us great!~~
AI is a force multiplier; it does 100x in the direction you point it. 

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

Code that works should not be changed.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

~~Code that works should not be changed.~~
- Value changes
- Time changes
- Place changes
- Habitable code is healthy

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

Code is documentation.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

~~Code is documentation.~~
It can be, but does it answer why?

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

Code freeze is a normal thing.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

~~Code freeze is a normal thing~~
- Code freeze is the cheapest method to minimize issues during a fixed time period
- Are you wealthy enough to buy cheap?

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

Performance does not matter.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in maintaining}

~~Performance does not matter.~~
It does if it is part of the value for the customer.

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in life}

Development is work.
.transition.clean

.TITLEALT{Fallacies in life}

~~Development is work.~~
You are allowed to have fun!

.===============================================================================
.TITLEALT{Fallacies in life}

Do not forget your own values!
